  "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-02.htm",
   "quest": 8,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Jasmine: You can visit many different places through the gate of time and space. The most cosmopolitan place of all is the Town of Giran! I wasn't there for long, but I can tell you that it's a very dynamic, vibrant place. There are all sorts of people searching for adventure and romance…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Jasmine",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; ((player.getRace() == Race.DARK_ELF) && (player.getLevel() >= MIN_LEVEL))"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"It sounds awesome! Can you send me there?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00008_AnAdventureBegins 30134-03.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins",
     "event": "30134-03.htm",
     "quest": 8,
     "to": "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-03.htm",
     "effect": "start"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-01.html",
   "quest": 8,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Jasmine: You can visit many places through this gate of time and space. My personal favorite, and the most cosmopolitan of all, is the Town of Giran! You'll find all sorts of people there, searching for adventure and romance. It's like a world unto itself! (Only Dark Elves of level 3 or …",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Jasmine",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; NOT ((player.getRace() == Race.DARK_ELF) && (player.getLevel() >= MIN_LEVEL))"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-04.html": {
   "file": "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-04.html",
   "quest": 8,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Jasmine: Which part of \"no\" don't you understand? Don't make a fool of yourself like Sentry Roselyn did. Come back when you've grown up!",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Jasmine",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-05.html",
   "quest": 8,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Jasmine: Well, if that's what Magister Harne said, I guess I can't help it. I didn't think Roselyn would blow the whistle! So, what do you want?",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Jasmine",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 3"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"As I said, I want to go to Giran.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00008_AnAdventureBegins 30134-06.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins",
     "event": "30134-06.html",
     "quest": 8,
     "to": "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-06.html",
     "effect": "reward"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-03.htm",
   "quest": 8,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Jasmine: You don't have the money, skills or background to even think of visiting a foreign country through the gate of time and space! You must be an idiot! Believe me, I'm telling you this for your own good! Don't embarrass yourself and your race! You'd certainly make the same mistake …",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Jasmine",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00008_AnAdventureBegins/30134-06.html",
   "quest": 8,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Jasmine: I'm afraid Giran may be too much for you right now. I can't send you there from here. If you insist on going there, take this Traveler's Mark and Scroll of Escape to the Town of Giran . The magic scroll allows you to instantaneously travel to Giran, but remember, it only works o…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Jasmine",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
